  "title": "Vertiv announces CTO leadership changes",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, announced that as part of a previously announced transition, Chief Technology Officer Stephen Liang will retire after three decades of distinguished service. Liang, who will step down from his role on January 1, 2026, has been instrumental in shaping the company’s technological vision since his earlier roles at Emerson and throughout Vertiv’s evolution. Earlier this year, he transitioned to focus exclusively on his CTO responsibilities, spearheading the company's technology strategy and innovation initiatives.",
